  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote the development of 30 latin people in vulnerable situations who live in Mexico, so that they can develop a business plan project that allows them the correct management of their productive activity; through an online business and life skills training, with emphasis on entrepreneurial, productive and training initiatives, so that they can self-employ and/or exercise an honest, useful, productive, and well paid quality job.</narrative>
